title: The Labour-Law Reconstruction
subtitle: Begin with the full Razem package; token enforcement is a fallback settlement, not a prerequisite.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 135
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_labor_reform_timer <= 0 and labor_reform_settled = 0 and labor_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_labor_reform_timer = 3;
Q.labor_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.labor_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const laborThresholds = [0, 24, 38, 56, 78];
Q.labor_reform_threshold = laborThresholds[Q.labor_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.labor_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 12 : 0) +
    (Q.economy_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 6 : 0) +
    (Q.finance_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 3 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.16 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_social) * 0.14 +
        Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) * 7 +
        Number(Q.pis_solidarist_share) * 0.12 -
        Number(Q.pis_market_hardliner_share) * 0.10;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.08 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_social) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.labor_ko_commitment) * 6 -
                Math.max(
                    0,
                    Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) - 45
                ) * 0.16
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.labor_third_way_commitment) * 4 -
                (p2050Cabinet
                    ? Math.max(
                        0,
                        Number(Q.p2050_personalist_share) - 35
                    ) * 0.08
                    : 0)
            : 0);
}
const publicBonus =
    Number(Q.labor_credibility) * 0.12 +
    Number(Q.union_trust) * 0.08 +
    Number(Q.opzz_cooperation) * 0.08 +
    Number(Q.labor_mobilization) * 0.10 -
    Number(Q.labor_dissent) * 0.10 +
    Number(Q.workers_support) * 0.10 +
    (Number(Q.social_spending_support) - 40) * 0.22 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.50;
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.05 +
    (Q.labor_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.labor_palace_commitment) * 5
        : 0);
Q.labor_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.labor_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus + palaceBonus -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind)
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "labor";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.labor_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/labour-inspection.webp

= A social package built over years

**Campaign goal:** [? if labor_reform_defined: [+ labor_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not labor_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
**Movement relationship:** [+ labor_relationship_label +]. Union trust [+
union_trust +]/100 · OPZZ cooperation [+ opzz_cooperation +]/100 ·
mobilisation [+ labor_mobilization +]/100 · reform conflict [+
labor_conflict +]/100.
[? if labor_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
labor_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ labor_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
labor_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not labor_reform_defined: The first project
action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining can
begin.?]

The numbered alternatives measure how far the original package is knocked
down. Enacting even token enforcement settles this campaign; it does not
unlock PIP reform as the next rung.

[? if eu_progressive_headwind > 0: Europe's rightward shift removes **[+
eu_progressive_headwind +] passage power** from this progressive reform. EU
social and trade-union organising can reduce that headwind; it cannot replace
a Polish majority.?]

[? if government_party = "pis": PiS's social-solidarist wing can vote for
inspectors, reclassification and stronger labour law. Its market wing will
still protect favoured employers, and outright hostility closes even the
shared social channel.?][? if government_party != "pis": KO and
[+ third_way_display_name +] accept enforcement language more readily than the
powers, contracts and money that make enforcement real.?]

[? if labor_minister_party = "Lewica": The Labour Ministry supplies inspectors,
drafting authority and an implementation map. It is a large advantage, not a
substitute for coalition votes.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as the full Razem labour package
subtitle: Contract reform, PIP powers and stronger labour law enter as one opening demand.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: labor_reform_defined = 1; labor_on_slate = 1; labor_reform_goal_stage = 4; labor_reform_proposal_stage = 4; labor_reform_next_stage = 4; labor_reform_progress += 12; labor_credibility += 4; union_trust += 2; opzz_cooperation += 2; labor_mobilization += 2; workers_support += 2; razem_cooperation += 2; news_headline = "Razem and Lewica Pracy define one full labour bill"

The implementation work can still divide the package into clauses, but the
political campaign no longer pretends that inspectors must be won before
contract rights can even be demanded.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep unions, inspectors and platform workers drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10; the drafting table builds trust and workplace capacity.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: labor_reform_progress += 10; labor_credibility += 1; union_trust += 2; opzz_cooperation += 2; labor_mobilization += 3; labor_dissent -= 2; razem_cooperation += 1; progressives_dissent -= 1; spring_dissent -= 1; news_headline = "The union drafting table keeps the labour reconstruction package ready"

The working group turns wage theft, sham self-employment, platform work and
inspection deadlines into one cumulative statute. No coalition partner can
later claim that only the maximal slogan existed.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Trade priorities with a possible coalition partner
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one labour pledge.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

Before power, this sets a social floor for coalition talks. In cabinet, it
turns a party relationship into votes for one defined fallback settlement.

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Make KO record a labour-law floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; labor_reform_progress += 8; labor_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; news_headline = "KO records a minimum labour-law pledge"

KO records a labour-law floor its business wing would rather never have seen
written down. It is a minimum, not the programme, and it is the number every
later negotiation now starts from.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the enforcement it will fund
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.resources -= 1; Q.labor_reform_progress += 8; Q.labor_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 3; Q.p2050_relation += 3; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records a labour-enforcement floor"; !}

[+ third_way_display_name +] names the enforcement it will fund rather than the
rights it will proclaim. Inspectors with a budget do more for a warehouse
worker than another article of the code.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Build the social-solidarist labour channel in PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or pis_negotiation_hostility_relief >= 5 or national_crisis_pressure >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not record a labour pledge without coalition ties, an established channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; labor_reform_progress += 8; labor_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; pis_solidarist_share += 2; pis_market_hardliner_share -= 2; news_headline = "PiS solidarists record support for a stronger labour package"

The solidarist wing records its support and the market wing loses ground inside
its own party. Lewica has strengthened a faction it does not control, on the
one file where the interests genuinely overlap.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Spend trust on votes for labour law
subtitle: Choose a 55+ relationship; it falls by 10 and becomes one recorded pledge.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55 or pis_relation >= 55 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on labour-law votes
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 10; labor_ko_commitment += 1; labor_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica cashes in KO trust for labour-law votes"

The goodwill becomes votes for labour law. KO's leadership treats the account
as closed, and the code gains clauses that will survive the next reshuffle.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on labour enforcement
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 10;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 10;
}
Q.labor_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.labor_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica cashes in " + Q.third_way_display_name + " trust for labour enforcement";
!}

[+ third_way_display_name +] pays in enforcement capacity, which is the half of
labour policy that never makes a headline and always decides whether the law is
felt.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on the social package
choose-if: pis_relation >= 55
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 10; labor_pis_commitment += 1; labor_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica cashes in PiS trust for labour-law votes"

PiS trust converts into votes on the social package and nothing beyond it. The
relationship is spent; the package clears its committee.

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the Labour Ministry produce the implementation file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14 and a lower practical threshold through ministry ownership.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and labor_minister_party = "Lewica" and budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Labour Ministry and one budget point.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; labor_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; labor_credibility += 2; union_trust += 4; opzz_cooperation += 4; labor_mobilization += 3; labor_dissent -= 3; government_delivery += 1; government_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "The Labour Ministry and unions map inspectors, deadlines and contract conversion"

Every regional office receives staffing, dates and model decisions. Coalition
partners may still vote no, but they can no longer cite an unknowable
implementation burden.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the enforcement and contract file before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace protocol needs one resource.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.labor_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.labor_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.labor_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.labor_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.labor_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the labour-law implementation protocol";
!}

The file separates inspectors, contract conversion and the strongest labour
rights into fallback settlements. A hostile President can still veto, but must now
identify the clause and price rather than reject an undefined social package.

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ labor_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; resistance may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: labor_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and labor_reform_power >= labor_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition and implementation power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "labor"; reform_pressure_target_stage = labor_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
